%%{init: {'theme': 'dark'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as 🌐 Browser
  participant S as ⚙️ Server

  rect rgb(20, 40, 35)
    Note over B,S: ── REGISTRATION ──
    B->>B: generate keypair (alice_pub / alice_priv)
    B->>B: wrap_key = Argon2(password)
    B->>B: encrypted_priv = encrypt(alice_priv, wrap_key)
    B->>S: POST /users { email, pubkey, fingerprint, encrypted_privkey }
    S->>S: user_id = HMAC(email, SERVER_PEPPER)
    S->>S: store { user_id, pubkey, fingerprint, encrypted_privkey }
    Note right of S: ✓ email discarded — never stored
    S-->>B: 201 OK
  end

  rect rgb(20, 30, 50)
    Note over B,S: ── LOGIN ──
    B->>S: POST /auth/init { email }
    S->>S: HMAC(email, PEPPER) → lookup record
    S-->>B: { encrypted_privkey, challenge: random_bytes }
    B->>B: privkey = decrypt(encrypted_privkey, Argon2(password))
    B->>B: sig = sign(challenge, privkey)
    B->>S: POST /auth/verify { fingerprint, sig }
    S->>S: verify(sig, challenge, pubkey) ✓
    S-->>B: { jwt }
  end

  rect rgb(50, 25, 25)
    Note over B,S: ── ACCOUNT RECOVERY (admin resets a friend) ──
    Note over B,S: Admin generates new invite link → friend re-registers
    Note over B,S: New keypair generated → admin re-encrypts all workspace DEKs
    Note over B,S: Old content readable · Old signatures show "key changed"
  end
